 "The result has four state updates, no recorded values, and a last step of \
",
 Cell[BoxData["0.002"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12d95fcb-3316-2212-42e7-569546a37178"],
 ". The unmonitored channel still changes the state."
